# 04 - SUSPICIOUS-ACTIVITY REPORT AND MODERATION
# Run this file after publishing products and BEFORE paying both laptop orders.
# The high-value product must still be publicly reportable.
# Access tokens expire after 15 minutes; rerun buyer/admin logins in file 01 if needed.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@buyerToken = PASTE_BUYER_JWT_HERE
@adminToken = PASTE_ADMIN_JWT_HERE
@highProductId = PASTE_LAPTOP_PRODUCT_UUID_HERE
@reportId = PASTE_REPORT_UUID_HERE

### REPORT THE HIGH-VALUE PRODUCT
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "targetType": "PRODUCT",
  "targetId": "{{highProductId}}",
  "reason": "SUSPICIOUS_ACTIVITY",
  "details": "Academic seed report verifying product evidence snapshots, reporter ownership, and moderation review."
}

### LIST REPORTER'S OWN REPORTS
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/mine?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### OPEN MODERATION QUEUE
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/moderation/reports?status=OPEN&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ESCALATE AND RESOLVE REPORT
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/moderation/reports/{{reportId}}/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "resolution": "ESCALATED",
  "action": "ESCALATED",
  "note": "Escalated for manual academic review; no automatic product mutation was performed.",
  "reporterMessage": "Your suspicious-activity report was reviewed and escalated for manual investigation."
}

### REPORTER READS FINAL RESOLUTION
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/{{reportId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Accept: application/json
